<title>GREECE: AVG GREEK FAMILY NEEDS 489,000-533,000 DRS/MONTH - EUROSTAT.</title>
<headline>AVG GREEK FAMILY NEEDS 489,000-533,000 DRS/MONTH - EUROSTAT.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>A Greek family of four members has</p>
<p>to make a minimum of 489,000 to 533,000 drachmas a month to live</p>
<p>comfortably, said Eurostat.</p>
<p>Two million Greek families live below the poverty line, it</p>
<p>said.</p>
<p>The monthly expenses and their drachma cost follows:</p>
<p>    Rent or monthly home loan payment    80,000-100,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Telephone				     7,000-10,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Water					   3,000- 4,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Electricity				  16,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Common expenses			    12,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Clothing, shoes			    15,000-20,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Food					  110,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Sanitary				     11,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Transport				    60,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Entertainment				30,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Foreign language lessons		 70,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Personal expenses			  35,000-50,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    Other costs				  40,000 drachmas</p>
<p>    TOTAL					 489,000-533,000 drachmas</p>
<p>--Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
